  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Taking the coordinates of vertices <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>O</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>)</mo></math>,&nbsp;respectively.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> The coordinates of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/f8cac160-83ae-4bf5-a06a-619f8a01946e-d49.png\" style=\"width: 333px; height: 170px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;Area of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>and area of the square <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> The required ratio is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn></math>.</p><p>Hence, option (c) is correct.</p>",
